---
# ESP-IDF glue: the apps and the ESP-only components under apps/components.
# The code here talks to ESP-IDF's C APIs and macros, so one check has no
# call-site fix. It stays on for the portable components (firmware/components)
# and the host tests.
#
#   hicpp-signed-bitwise
#       ESP_LOGx expands to `(level) | ESP_LOG_CONFIGS_DEFAULT` on signed
#       enums, so it fires on every log call (and on the NimBLE flag macros).
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -hicpp-signed-bitwise,
...
